      "value": "<div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong>Frequency </strong>Once per day</p><hr></div><p class=\"MsoNormal\">You can read the fortunes of a group of people as if their fates were all intertwined. When you perform your Daily Divination, you can do a reading for up to five creatures, which can include yourself. You can either use a single draw for all creatures, thus tying them all to the same suit, or a draw for each individual creature.</p>"
